{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"41000120955","bookName":"Castigada por su amor (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x1/41x0/410x0/41000120955/41000120955.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":50266838,"followCount":1088609,"introduction":"Ella era una mujer desamparada que dependía de los demás. Se vio obligada a ser un chivo expiatorio y a vender su cuerpo, hasta que se quedó embarazada. Él creía que ella era la personificación del mal, la avaricia y el engaño. Ella trató por todos los medios de conquistar su corazón, pero fracasó. Su marcha le enfureció tanto que la buscó por todos los rincones del mundo y al final logró encontrarla. Toda la ciudad sabía que acabaría hecha añicos.","chapterCount":63,"labels":["Love After Marriage","Forced Love"],"tags":["Love After Marriage","Forced Love"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Castigada-por-su-amor-Doblado","bookNameLower":"castigada-por-su-amor-doblado","shelfTime":"2025-09-05 09:48:03","firstShelfTime":"2025-09-05 09:48:03","performerList":[{"performerId":"12222","performerName":"Neven Tomic","performerFormatName":"Neven-Tomic","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/2x2/12222/12222.jpg?time=1793869836280","videoCount":8},{"performerId":"29158","performerName":"Rue Austin","performerFormatName":"Rue-Austin","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x5/29158/29158.jpg?time=1780018507372","videoCount":2}],"performerIdList":[12222,29158]},"chapterList":[{"id":"600081606","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/60/5x5/55x9/559x0/55902100014/600081606_1/600081606.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795201200&Signature=vJF1z3zTPr9HUEVtj4UfStT-DEhIfqovI~RUgTM4ODr3eBrjFzGvmIUPqm5Kl86~IR8rsw3MyDnaEP472064MLGSKHamckask0sIsq5-0oKL1N0c1o5V9mY2YE4NTKOXjgXq91g977wecE~phRLdfgK